{"id":"rock-golem","name":{"en":"Rock Golem","ja":"ロックゴーレム","tc":"石魔巨人","sc":"石魔巨人"},"desc1":{"en":"I should be able to hear the voice of therock! It's saying a store nearby is having a sale!","ja":"「石の声なら聴けるはずっ！むっ！この子…。　近くのお店で特売してるって言ってる！」","tc":"「既然是石頭，我應該聽得見聲音！唔！　牠說……附近的店在大特價！」","sc":"“既然是石头，我应该听得见声音！唔！　它说……附近的店在大特价！”"},"desc2":{"en":"You didn't mishear that? I don't wanta monster that acts like a person.","ja":"「それ、本当…？聞き間違いじゃなくて…？　そんな庶民じみた魔物、私はイヤよ…？」","tc":"「這是真的嗎……？確定不是妳聽錯了……？　這麼像平民的魔物我可不想遇到喔……？」","sc":"“这是真的吗……？确定不是你听错了……？　这么像平民的魔物我可不想遇到哦……？”"},"char1":"firis","char2":"liane","kind":"alchemic","hp":956,"atk":79,"defen":60,"spd":8,"level":35,"exp":281,"cole":70,"slash":4,"impact":2,"pierce":4,"magic":2,"fire":2,"ice":1,"light":2,"ail":3,"item_set":[{"id":"red-sand","name":{"en":"Red Sand","ja":"赤砂","tc":"紅砂","sc":"红砂"}},{"id":"black-sand","name":{"en":"Black Sand","ja":"黒砂","tc":"黑砂","sc":"黑砂"}},{"id":"white-sand","name":{"en":"White Sand","ja":"白砂","tc":"白砂","sc":"白砂"}},{"id":"white-ashstone","name":{"en":"White Ashstone","ja":"白灰岩","tc":"石灰岩","sc":"石灰岩"}},{"id":"tamahagane","name":{"en":"Tamahagane","ja":"玉鋼石","tc":"玉鋼石","sc":"玉钢石"}},{"id":"gravistone","name":{"en":"Gravistone","ja":"グラビ石","tc":"重力石","sc":"重力石"}},{"id":"black-star-stone","name":{"en":"Black Star Stone","ja":"漆黒の星の石","tc":"漆黑之星的石頭","sc":"漆黑之星的石头"}},{"id":"magnet-stone-shard","name":{"en":"Magnet Stone Shard","ja":"磁鉄岩のカケラ","tc":"磁鐵岩的碎片","sc":"磁铁岩的碎片"}},{"id":"flame-sword","name":{"en":"Flame Sword","ja":"焔光剣","tc":"焰光劍","sc":"焰光剑"}},{"id":"wyrmsoul","name":{"en":"Wyrmsoul","ja":"ウィルムソウル","tc":"亞龍之魂","sc":"亚龙之魂"}},{"id":"halberd","name":{"en":"Halberd","ja":"ハルベルト","tc":"槍斧","sc":"枪斧"}},{"id":"white-wing-spear","name":{"en":"White Wing Spear","ja":"白翼の槍","tc":"白翼之槍","sc":"白翼之枪"}},{"id":"scale-vest","name":{"en":"Scale Vest","ja":"スケイルベスト","tc":"鱗甲背心","sc":"鳞甲背心"}},{"id":"gold-chain-armor","name":{"en":"Gold Chain Armor","ja":"金鎖の鎧","tc":"金鎖之鎧","sc":"金锁之铠"}}],"locations":[{"id":"leafy-laforet",